      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently, a lot more dependency jars end up in the war-file, e.g. `commons-logging`, which is a transitive dependency of e.g. `commons-validator`. Further, we have multiple versions of the same dependency, e.g. `commons-logging-1.1.1.jar` and `commons-logging-1.2.jar`.",
      "revId": "178b4f2d1ad8e7a65e742615d769f19bc6746cc9",
      "serverId": "173816e5-2b9a-37c3-8a2e-48639d4f1153"
    },
