      "writtenOn": "2026-01-23T14:46:21Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "One solution would be to explicitely exclude transient dependencies by adding this:\n\n```\nmaven.install(\n  ...\n    excluded_artifacts \u003d [\n        \"commons-logging:commons-logging\",\n    ]\n)\n```",
      "parentUuid": "d6d8de62_4cb4e434",
