      "writtenOn": "2026-02-07T19:41:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for calling this out.\n\nI added a report comparing the previously built headless.war\n(`maven_jar`-based setup) against the WAR produced by this change [1].\n\nThe observed differences are expected and understood:\n- Newly added jars correspond to runtime dependencies that were\n  already present on the Bazel classpath but were previously not\n  packaged as standalone artifacts in the WAR.\n- Removed jars reflect version alignment (e.g. gson, protobuf,\n  sshd, commons-text) and case-normalization differences.\n- Guava / Caffeine artifacts are unchanged, apart from the explicit\n  renaming of caffeine-guava to avoid name collisions.\n\n[1]: https://paste.opendev.org/show/bCkTJRoD09ZNCLoOCGrK/",
      "parentUuid": "eab7665d_62ad4aa6",
      "revId": "178b4f2d1ad8e7a65e742615d769f19bc6746cc9",
